        <item>
            <title>Version 1.0.2</title>
            <sparkle:version>3</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.0.2</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>11.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <pubDate>Thu, 09 Jul 2026 18:45:00 +0000</pubDate>
            <description><![CDATA[
                <h2>What's New</h2>
                <ul>
                    <li>Event names no longer show "(Override)" or doubled schedule names</li>
                    <li>Layout now adapts cleanly to 4:3 and vertical half-screen displays</li>
                    <li>Sidebar cards no longer clip event names; long room lists trim neatly</li>
                    <li>Display keeps the last good schedule if an eSpace refresh fails</li>
                    <li>Server auto-restarts if it crashes</li>
                    <li>New menu item to copy the network URL for other machines</li>
                    <li>Menu bar icon is now the Northwoods pin</li>
                    <li>Security hardening in the local web server</li>
                </ul>
            ]]></description>
            <enclosure
                url="https://github.com/NorthwoodsCommunityChurch/Northwoods-Wayfind/releases/download/v1.0.2/Northwoods-Wayfind-v1.0.2.zip"
